<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!--
        Two tweaks to the printed check, requested by UFS.

        Both are done by injecting a small stylesheet into the check face
        template (l10n_us_check_printing.ckus_check). A style tag rendered
        anywhere on the page applies to the whole printout, so this one
        block reaches both the check face and the stub.

        Done as CSS rather than by rearranging the template because the
        check fields are positioned by fixed coordinates in the layout's
        own stylesheet, so a nudge is a style override, not a move in the
        markup, and it carries no risk of breaking the report.

        1. Address down for the window. The payee address (.ckus_payee_addr)
           sits too high for the #9 window, so we shift it down a quarter
           inch. translateY moves it relative to its current position, so
           we do not need to know the layout's original coordinate. Expect
           one test print to confirm the exact amount against the real
           check stock, the same as we did for invoices.

        2. Remove the itemized bill list. The stub lists every invoice being
           paid (.stub_lines). This hides that table while leaving the stub
           summary and total. If the "invoices on the check" they mean is
           actually the memo line on the check face rather than this stub
           table, switch the second rule to target .ckus_memo instead. We
           will confirm against their screenshot on the test print.

        Covers the pre-printed layouts (Print Check Top/Middle/Bottom). If
        UFS switches to a Blank Check layout, ckus_check_blank needs the
        same override added.
    -->
    <template id="ckus_check_ufs_tweaks"
              inherit_id="l10n_us_check_printing.ckus_check">
        <xpath expr="//div[hasclass('ckus_check')]" position="inside">
            <style>
                .ckus_payee_addr { transform: translateY(6.35mm); }
                .stub_lines { display: none !important; }
            </style>
        </xpath>
    </template>
</odoo>
